BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dhardo Rinpoche Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260322T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260322T170000
UID:95444886088161ffe3c49d71@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Dhardo Rinpoche was an important teacher and friend to Sanghar
 akshita\, the founder of the Triratna Buddhist Community. On the 36th anni
 versary of his death we will explore the influence he had on our tradition
  and the effect of a life lived in service of others.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/dhardo-rinpoche-day-a-ce
 lebration-2026-03-22
